kitty-image-release

From: Victor Araújo <victor@victor-software-house.com>

Downstream-Reason: Free the GPU texture of a kitty image the terminal no longer shows, so images scrolling past do not grow memory without bound.
Upstream-Status: not-submitted
Drop-When: Upstream herdr-app releases kitty image textures from the GPUI atlas when it drops them from its cache.
---
